hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2808","**\nNarrated to us 'Ali ibn Hujr al-Sa'di and Yusuf ibn Musa, who said: Narrated to us Jarir, on the authority of al-Mughirah, from Musa ibn Ziyad ibn Hizaym al-Sa'di, from his father, from his grandfather Hudhaym ibn 'Amr, who said:\nI heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) delivering a sermon on the Day of 'Arafah during the Farewell Pilgrimage, saying:\n\"Know that your lives, your wealth, and your honour are sacred to you, just as sacred is this day of yours, just as sacred is this month of yours, and just as sacred is this city of yours.\""
